# Rename map for Prehistoric Tribes.
# Only members whose role was confirmed from call sites are renamed;
# see CLASS_MAP.md for the evidence and for what is still unknown.
# Anything not listed keeps its name.
#
# Format (one per line):
#   class <old> <New>
#   field <oldClass>.<oldField>:<javaType> <newName>
#   method <oldClass>.<oldMethod>(<paramTypes>):<returnType> <newName>
# The field type and the method return type are part of the key: this
# obfuscator reuses one letter for many members in the same class (23 fields
# named `a` in class f; 49 method name+params groups that differ only by
# return type). A key without the type would be ambiguous.

class tribes TribesMIDlet
class f Game
class b World
class e ResourceLoader
class c TextLoader
class d Splash
class a MidiPlayer

method b.ak():void checkWinLose
method f.aw():void openCustomGame

